# Initial state: the shared spike fixture (Setup.sixAgentWorld, 32 x 32,
# seed 20260902) — resolved by name from Corpus.all, not serialised.
#
# canonical 4 and every hash below were re-pinned by TASK-028
# (Canonical.FormatVersion 3 -> 4, AgentState.Order / .Disposition sections
# added). The spike fixture is enemy-free, so all three recipients Accept at
# appraisal: the 24 ticks are unchanged and the only behaviour change is one
# OrderAppraised event per recipient (72 -> 75 domain events).
